From: lfdevs <lfdevs@lfdevs.com>
Date: Sun, 19 Jul 2026 02:26:59 +0800
Subject: backend-anland: add camera resource service

Request the Anland 5.13 camera service after each consumer connection and adopt its control and per-camera stream descriptors with explicit ownership across fallback and reconnect.

Expose persistent PipeWire Video/Source nodes backed by the consumer's shared-memory double buffers. Validate protocol framing, descriptor handoff, dimensions, formats, slot sizes, and frame allocations before publishing camera data.

Stop active captures and release every consumer resource on fallback while retaining virtual nodes for reconnect, and rebuild PipeWire state asynchronously when its core disappears.
